This repository provides data and images for the "A Thousand Dreams" apps
(Android and iOS) published by Khun Tech. It is public only so that those
apps can download their content.

1. Protected content (all rights reserved)
   The following were created or compiled by Khun Tech and are protected:
   - the dream card images in cards/ and the Realistic 3D card images in cards3d/
   - the app icon and other images in assets/
   - the card list, card names and their translations (cards/cards.json)
   - the selection, arrangement, editing and translations of the dream
     dictionary in dreamdict/
   - the watch lists in watchlist/
   - the scripts and code in scripts/ and server/

   No permission is given to copy, download in bulk, redistribute, modify,
   sell, or use this content in any other app, website, product or service,
   including training or feeding AI models, without prior written permission
   from Khun Tech. Viewing the content inside the official A Thousand Dreams
   apps is allowed.

2. Not claimed
   - Thai Government Lottery results (lottery.json, history/, next_draw.json)
     are public information from the Government Lottery Office (glo.or.th).
     Khun Tech claims no ownership of these numbers and dates.
   - Traditional Myanmar dream meanings are cultural heritage. Only the
     compilation, editing and translations described in section 1 are claimed.

3. No warranty
   The content is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Always
   check lottery results with the official source (glo.or.th).

